    "etsyDescription": "\"Remember the thrill of battling your favorite Pokémon? This Entei back print shirt captures that magic perfectly. Slip it on, and you’ll feel like you’re ready to take on any Trainer!\"  \n\nDive into the world of nostalgic vibes with this incredible design showcasing Entei. The large back print bursts with fiery energy reminiscent of Saturday morning cartoons; it's a tribute to those cherished moments spent immersed in the adventures of our favorite Pokémon. Each glance at its vibrant colors will transport you straight back to your childhood battlefield!  \n\nThis premium unisex cotton t-shirt is made from 100% soft cotton for ultimate comfort during long days out — whether you're at a convention or just hanging out with friends. Available in sizes S-3XL, it's designed to fit everyone who wants to sport their love for Pokémon in style!  \n\nIs there a friend whose birthday calls for a nostalgic surprise? This shirt makes an unforgettable gift for any Pokemon enthusiast or those who grew up in the golden era of anime. They’ll appreciate both the sentiment and the style when they rock this unique piece!  \n\nMachine wash cold, tumble dry low. Made to order — ships in 3-5 business days.",
